    text: "@scene_meta_participants: Queen Eduhauana, Lord Commander Enlil, War-Matron Tiamat, War-Sage Marduk"
  - line: 12
    type: narration
    text: "@scene_meta_focus: On the war-moon above Sol-3, Anunnaki leadership notes that 73% of the Igigi successfully scattered across quantum foam; Queen Eduhauana orders Nibiru moved into permanent eclipse positioning to trigger planetary ice-age protocols as punishment for indigenous resistance and refugee survival."
  - line: 13
    type: narration
